@startuml

title Cache-Aside: look in the cache, load on a miss

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "reader" as r
database "cache\n(in memory)" as c
participant "source" as s

r -> c : get key K
alt a hit, still fresh
  c --> r : value
else a miss, or close to expiry
  r -> s : load K
  s --> r : value, with its lifetime
  r -> c : put K (bounded, evicted on expiry)
end
note over r, s
  the source stays the system of record;
  the cache may be empty at any time and work goes on
end note
@enduml
